message: "If you use this preprint or verification code, please cite this release."
title: "Cohomological Rejuvenation: Tissues That Heal Their Own Incoherence"
abstract: >-
  A falsifiable framework separating local tissue mismatch under learned
  cellular-sheaf compatibility maps from cycle-level cohomological obstruction.
  Includes reproducible finite-dimensional checks and a proposed donor-held-out
  analysis of spatial aging data. No biological atlas was analysed in this release.
